# LeakSanitizer suppressions for fuzz runs.
#
# The thread-local bump arena (GV_Arena, allocated in gv_tls_arena) is a
# deliberate per-thread cache that lives for the lifetime of the thread. On
# normal thread exit it is freed by the pthread TLS destructor; on process exit
# an atexit handler frees the main thread's arena. libFuzzer, however,
# terminates via _Exit(), which runs LSan's leak check BEFORE atexit handlers
# fire, so the main thread's still-reachable arena is reported. This is not a
# real leak, only a shutdown-ordering artifact of the fuzzing driver.
leak:gv_arena_init
leak:gv_tls_arena
